flowchart TD
    U[User request] --> R[QA Orchestrator Skill]
    R --> D{Classify intent}
    D -->|Explore / coverage / plan| P[Playwright Planner]
    D -->|Approved plan / implement| G[Playwright Generator]
    D -->|Observed E2E failure| H[Playwright Healer]
    P --> PLAN[e2e/plans/*.md]
    PLAN --> REVIEW[Review against accepted SpecKit requirements]
    REVIEW -->|Plan only| REPORT[Evidence and QA report]
    REVIEW -->|User requested implementation / approved| G
    G --> SPECS[e2e/tests/*.spec.js + e2e/pages/*]
    SPECS --> RUN[Run on isolated E2E stack :18088]
    RUN -->|Pass| REPORT
    RUN -->|Fail| H
    H --> ROOT{Root cause}
    ROOT -->|Test-only issue| FIX[Minimal test-only repair]
    FIX --> RUN
    ROOT -->|Application / business defect| ISSUE[Report separately; do not hide]
    ISSUE --> REPORT
    REPORT --> DONE[Prime agent reviews diff, docs, test evidence and Git state]

    subgraph Safety boundary
      SAFE[Synthetic data only · isolated DB · sequential suite]
      DOMAIN[Backend JUnit owns financial arithmetic]
      NO[No production DB · no weakened assertions · no unrequested commit]
    end
    P -. obeys .-> SAFE
    G -. obeys .-> SAFE
    H -. obeys .-> NO
    G -. never duplicates .-> DOMAIN
